    <!--
        weka:weka:3.5.8 was originally served only by http://obsearch.net/repository/, an HTTP-only repository that
        recent Maven versions block, so the dependency could no longer be resolved. The very same artifact was taken
        from there and republished on the ProtoQSAR Nexus (https://nexus.protoqsar.com/repository/maven-public/),
        which is now its only source: it is resolved through the repositories declared in the parent pom.
        The version is unchanged, so the model predictions are unchanged.
    -->


    <name>Developmental Toxicity model (CAESAR)</name>
    <description>
        QSAR classification model for Developmental Toxicity (from CAESAR project)
    </description>

